  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/e306d0edaa1c360a9dc63af39b3f34da9440d14853e714d54d6553647fbc3ba8.png] \n\nGiven equation: 198 * 11 * 18 * 20 * 50 * 294\n\nOption 1) ÷ , ×, = , + , – \n\nBy replacing the * signs:\n\n⇒ __**198 ÷ 11**__ × 18 = 20 + 50 - 294\n\n⇒ __18____** ×**____** 18**__ = __**20 + 50**__ - 294\n\n⇒ 324 = __**70 - 294**__\n\n⇒ 324 = -224\n\nOption 2) ÷ , + , ×, – , = \n\nBy replacing the * signs:\n\n⇒ __**198 ÷ 11**__ + 18 × 20 - 50 = 294\n\n⇒ 18 + __**18 × 20**__ - 50 = 294\n\n⇒ __**18 + 360**__ - 50 = 294\n\n⇒ __**540 - 50**__ = 294\n\n⇒ 490 = 294\n\nOption 3) ÷ , ×, – , + , = \n\nBy replacing the * signs:\n\n⇒ __**198 ÷ 11**__ × 18 - 20 + 50 = 294\n\n⇒ __**18 × 18**__ - 20 + 50 = 294\n\n⇒ __**324**__ - 20 __**+ 50**__ = 294\n\n⇒ **__374 - 20__ **= 294\n\n⇒ 354 = 294\n\n**Option 4) ÷ ,×, + , –, =**\n\nBy replacing the * signs:\n\n⇒ __**198 ÷ 11**__ × 18 + 20 - 50 = 294\n\n⇒ __**18 × 18**__ + 20 - 50 = 294\n\n⇒ __**324 + 20**__ - 50 = 294\n\n⇒ __**344 - 50**__ = 294\n\n**⇒ 294 = 294**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**÷ ,×, + , –, =\"**.",
